      "$comment": "Keyed by host. A host that matches a redirect_host_pattern uses the parameters recorded for any listed host under the same pattern (region prefixes vary). S1-03a added response-content-type: the Hub sends it on small LFS files such as tokenizer.json (curl -sI 2026-09-24). 2026-09-25: the CDN began adding `xip`; without it every real-network model load was refused by net.ts. Redirect parameter names drift; the weekly health check should diff the observed names against this list."
    },
